{"seq":1,"slug":"environmental-monitoring","title":"大学环境工程 — 环境监测：用数据感知污染","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/environmental-engineering/environmental-systems/environmental-monitoring","wordCount":1686,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学环境工程-环境监测-用数据感知污染\">大学环境工程 — 环境监测：用数据感知污染</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>前面三章我们一直在&quot;治理&quot;污染，但治理的前提是先&quot;看见&quot;污染。环境监测就是环境工程的眼睛和耳朵——它用一整套采样、分析、数据处理的方法，把看不见摸不着的污染变成一串可量化、可追溯、可执法的数字。没有监测，所有的排放标准都只是纸面文字；有了监测，&quot;超标&quot;才成为一个可以裁决的事实。</p>\n<p>环境监测的对象覆盖水、气、声、土、生态等多个介质。它最核心的几个概念是：<strong>布点</strong>（在哪里采样才有代表性）、<strong>采样</strong>（如何取到真实样品而不被污染）、<strong>分析方法</strong>（用什么仪器测、灵敏度多高）、<strong>质量保证与质量控制（QA/QC）</strong>（如何确保数据可信）。其中 QA/QC 是监测的灵魂——一个数据如果不可信，再精密的仪器也毫无意义。近年最大的变化，是从&quot;人工定期采样&quot;快速走向&quot;在线自动连续监测&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"监测的基本流程\">监测的基本流程</h3><p>环境监测不是&quot;拿瓶子接点水拿去化验&quot;这么简单，它是一条严谨的链条，任何一环出错都会让结论失真：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[监测方案设计] --&gt; B[布点采样]&#10;    B --&gt; C[样品保存运输]&#10;    C --&gt; D[实验室分析]&#10;    D --&gt; E[数据处理]&#10;    E --&gt; F[评价与报告]\">graph LR\n    A[监测方案设计] --&gt; B[布点采样]\n    B --&gt; C[样品保存运输]\n    C --&gt; D[实验室分析]\n    D --&gt; E[数据处理]\n    E --&gt; F[评价与报告]</pre><p><strong>布点</strong>讲究代表性。比如测一条河的水质，要在排污口上游设对照点、排污口下游设控制点，才能看出污染的真实贡献。<strong>采样</strong>讲究不被二次污染，测重金属的瓶子和测有机物的瓶子材质不同，样品还要按要求冷藏、加保存剂、限时送检——否则氨氮可能在路上就被微生物&quot;吃掉&quot;了。这些看似琐碎的规矩，本质上都是为了让最后那个数字真实可信。</p>\n<h3 id=\"常见污染物的监测指标\">常见污染物的监测指标</h3><p>不同介质有各自的核心监测项，下面这张表帮你建立&quot;监测什么&quot;的框架：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>介质</th>\n<th>核心监测指标</th>\n<th>常用方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>地表水</td>\n<td>COD、氨氮、总磷、溶解氧</td>\n<td>分光光度法、电极法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>废气（固定源）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>NO</mtext><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{NO}_x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、颗粒物</td>\n<td>CEMS 在线监测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境空气</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>PM</mtext><mn>2.5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PM}_{2.5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PM</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2.5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>PM</mtext><mn>10</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PM}_{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PM</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{O}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>自动监测站</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>噪声</td>\n<td>等效声级 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{eq}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>声级计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>土壤</td>\n<td>重金属、有机污染物</td>\n<td>原子吸收、色谱质谱</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意废气和空气的区别：<strong>固定源废气</strong>是从烟囱排出的&quot;源头&quot;，用烟气在线监测系统（CEMS）实时盯住企业排放；<strong>环境空气</strong>是我们呼吸的&quot;环境质量&quot;，由遍布城市的自动监测站测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>PM</mtext><mn>2.5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PM}_{2.5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PM</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2.5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 等，最终汇成你手机上看到的 AQI 空气质量指数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"质量保证与质量控制-qa-qc\">质量保证与质量控制（QA/QC）</h3><p>为什么同一份样品，不同实验室测出来的结果可能不同？这正是 QA/QC 要解决的问题。工程上用一系列手段把误差关进笼子：做<strong>空白试验</strong>排除试剂污染、做<strong>平行样</strong>检验精密度、做<strong>加标回收</strong>检验准确度、用<strong>标准物质</strong>校准仪器。一个监测数据要能上法庭、能作为执法依据，背后必须有完整的 QA/QC 记录支撑。</p>\n<p>衡量数据可靠性的一个基础概念是误差。例如加标回收率反映准确度，理想情况下回收率应接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>回收率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>加标样测定值</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>样品测定值</mtext></mrow><mtext>加标量</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{回收率} = \\frac{\\text{加标样测定值} - \\text{样品测定值}}{\\text{加标量}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">回收率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">加标量</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">加标样测定值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">样品测定值</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>如果回收率偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span> 太远（比如只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span> 或高达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>130</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">130\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">130%</span></span></span></span></span>），就说明分析过程存在系统性问题，这批数据不能用。正是这种近乎苛刻的自我检验，让环境数据具备了执法的公信力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"在线自动监测的兴起\">在线自动监测的兴起</h3><p>过去监测靠人工定期采样，一个月测几次，企业很容易在&quot;采样日&quot;之外偷排。如今的趋势是<strong>在线自动连续监测</strong>：水里有水质自动监测站、烟囱上装 CEMS、空气有自动监测网，数据实时联网上传到生态环境部门。2025 年发布了多项自动监测技术规范（如水质自动监测仪、固定源废气自动监测系统的相关标准），2026 年还在推进对污染设施的视频监控与联网要求。这意味着监测正从&quot;抽查&quot;走向&quot;全天候盯防&quot;，数据造假的空间被大幅压缩。对学习者来说，掌握仪器原理之外，还要理解数据如何联网、如何防篡改——这是数字时代环境监测的新内涵。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>测一条河受某工厂排污影响时，为什么要在排污口的上游和下游都设监测点？只测下游会有什么问题？</li>\n<li>测氨氮的水样为什么要冷藏并尽快送检？如果放置过久，结果可能偏高还是偏低，为什么？</li>\n<li>&quot;固定源废气监测&quot;和&quot;环境空气质量监测&quot;有什么区别？它们各自服务于什么管理目的？</li>\n<li>某次加标回收率算出来是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>65</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">65\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65%</span></span></span></span></span>，这说明分析过程可能出了什么问题？这批数据还能用吗？</li>\n<li>在线自动监测相比人工定期采样有哪些优势？又带来了哪些新挑战（比如数据真实性如何保障）？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>生态环境部&quot;生态环境监测&quot;专栏——可查阅最新的监测技术规范与标准</li>\n<li>《地表水环境质量标准》（GB 3838）——理解地表水分类与各指标限值的依据</li>\n<li>在手机上安装一个空气质量 App，连续记录一周本地 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>PM</mtext><mn>2.5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PM}_{2.5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PM</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2.5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 AQI 的变化，结合天气思考污染成因</li>\n<li>有条件可参观本地的环境监测站或实验室，亲眼看看采样瓶、分光光度计和 CEMS 系统如何工作</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>环境监测是环境工程的&quot;眼睛&quot;，把无形的污染转化为可执法的数据。它遵循&quot;布点—采样—分析—数据处理—评价&quot;的严谨链条，而 QA/QC（空白、平行、加标回收、标准物质）是保证数据可信的灵魂。固定源废气与环境空气监测服务于不同管理目的。在线自动连续监测正取代人工抽查，把监管推向全天候。下一节我们把监测的&quot;事后感知&quot;延伸到&quot;事前预防&quot;，看看环境影响评价如何在项目动工前就为环境把关。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学环境工程 — 环境监测：用数据感知污染","id":"大学环境工程-环境监测-用数据感知污染"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"监测的基本流程","id":"监测的基本流程"},{"level":3,"text":"常见污染物的监测指标","id":"常见污染物的监测指标"},{"level":3,"text":"质量保证与质量控制（QA/QC）","id":"质量保证与质量控制-qa-qc"},{"level":3,"text":"在线自动监测的兴起","id":"在线自动监测的兴起"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学环境工程 — 固废资源化与循环经济","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/environmental-engineering/solid-waste-treatment/resource-recovery"},"next":{"title":"大学环境工程 — 环境影响评价：动工之前先把关","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/environmental-engineering/environmental-systems/environmental-impact-assessment"}}